The CloudThinker coding agent (`cloudthinker agent`) is built on the pi agent
harness by Mario Zechner (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi), which is
licensed under the MIT License. The agent depends on these pi packages:

- @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent
- @earendil-works/pi-tui

The agent also carries a patched copy of @tintinweb/pi-subagents by tintinweb
(https://github.com/tintinweb/pi-subagents), which is licensed under the MIT
License. The patch is agent-cli/patches/@tintinweb__pi-subagents@0.19.0.patch.

The agent's diff view uses jsdiff (the `diff` package, https://github.com/kpdecker/jsdiff),
which is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License.

The license texts of these components follow.

The embedded Cyber discovery runtime includes the pure-Python PyYAML 6.0.3
package, licensed under the MIT License. Its license text is included as
`vendor/PyYAML-LICENSE` inside `runtime/cyber-discovery.pyz`.

